 recalibrate as  the president  biden has put it this relationship  um and he didn't do that you know  i mean again there was no  real diplomacy going on uh there was no  effort to really end this war in yemen  in an aggressive way  there was no effort to uh to tone down  the ambitions  uh of the crown prince and his ambitions  are are some of them are personal for  his own power and  influence right but many of them are  also for his country  and we needed to be sure that that you  know we can offset the influence that  other countries like china  um would begin to have um  instead trump was focusing only on the  sale of military  hardware yes and and i i thought that  was  absolutely wrong uh we've been speaking  with former u.s ambassador to saudi  arabia arabia joseph westfall  uh i so appreciate your time today and  this will certainly be an issue we will  continue discussing  wonderful to be with you david thank you  very much

